# Real credentials.
#
# overlays/dev/secrets/*.env is deliberately NOT ignored — those are the values
# already published in the repo's appsettings.json, and committing them is what makes
# `kubectl apply -k overlays/dev` a one-command deploy.
#
# The homelab overlay has no secrets directory at all: its six Secrets are created in the
# namespace by Ansible, so nothing sensitive passes through this repository or its CI.

# Rendered output, when someone runs `make build` to eyeball a diff.
/out/
*.rendered.yaml
